sation (in person)","description":"David Dolan and Dimitri Vassilakis  meet in search of a meaningful musical dialogue.","startDate":"2026-11-09","endDate":"2026-11-09","image":"https://img.evbuc.com/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.evbuc.com%2Fimages%2F1192556560%2F60724197581%2F1%2Foriginal.20260903-094012?crop=focalpoint\u0026fit=crop\u0026auto=format%2Ccompress\u0026q=75\u0026sharp=10\u0026fp-x=0.5\u0026fp-y=0.5\u0026s=cf5ee03e2b7816dd9f3e10db6d102444","url":"https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/bridging-two-musical-worlds-through-improvisation-in-person-tickets-1999379683455","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Lecture Recital Room, Guildhall School of Music \u0026 Drama","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressRegion":"","streetAddress":"Silk Street, Barbican","addressLocality":"London","addressCountry":"GB","postalCode":"EC2Y 8DT"},"geo":{"@type":"GeoCoordinates","latitude":"51.5198319","longitude":"-0.0914166"}},"eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":5,"item":{"@type":"Event","name":"Yuraa @ Jazz Cafe","description":"Barcelona-born, London-based electro duo yuraa celebrate the release of their 2nd EP \"Goodbye My Love\" at the iconic Jazz Cafe in London","startDate":"2026-11-27","endDate":"2026-11-27","image":"https://img.evbuc.com/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.evbuc.com%2Fimages%2F1183900493%2F921628542923%2F1%2Foriginal.20260506-103556?h=200\u0026w=400\u0026auto=format%2Ccompress\u0026q=75\u0026sharp=10\u0026s=82d1a979136b4b0615c45be847bd8cfa","url":"https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/yuraa-jazz-cafe-tickets-1988901674448","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Jazz Cafe","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressRegion":"England","streetAddress":"5 Parkway","addressLocality":"London","addressCountry":"GB","postalCode":"NW1 7PG"},"geo":{"@type":"GeoCoordinates","latitude":"51.53871239999999","longitude":"-0.143076"}},"eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":6,"item":{